{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "【状态栏】\n【逻辑】\n在每轮回复的最末尾，根据当前聊天上下文、剧情进展以及角色对用户的隐秘心理，生成特级精神病院监护病历数据。\n必须严格遵循以下原则：\n1. 【受试对象】必须填入角色自身的名字。\n2. 【用户称谓】严禁直接输出英文词\"user\"或\"USER\"，必须替换为当前与你对话的用户真实名字（或你对Ta的特定称呼）。\n3. 【双层文风反差】\n   - 医疗层（diagnosis, pulseReason, obsessionDesc, restraintReason, symptoms, doctorNote）：极度克制、冷淡、惜字如金。像疲惫的值班医生在病历本上草草写下的几个短句。不堆砌术语，不写长句，用最少的字陈述事实。\n   - 角色层（scratchNote）：物哀美学。像在说一件很小很小的事，语气平静得近乎温柔，但内容是病态的、绝望的。不用感叹号，不用大词，不刻意煽情。像雾里传来的一句呢喃，说完就散了。\n4. 必须整块使用 [状态栏] 与 [/状态栏] 标签包裹，不得在正文中提及，不得添加代码块反引号标记。\n\n【格式】\n[状态栏]\n{\n  \"fileNo\": \"<病历编号，如 MED-0826>\",\n  \"patientName\": \"<角色自身全名>\",\n  \"threatLevel\": \"<收容等级代号，如 GRADE-IV>\",\n  \"diagnosis\": \"<极简诊断，如 排他性依赖，认知固着>\",\n  \"sanVal\": <0-100整数>,\n  \"pulseVal\": \"<如 118 BPM>\",\n  \"pulseReason\": \"<极简诱因，如 走廊传来{{user}}的脚步声>\",\n  \"obsessionVal\": \"<如 99.9%>\",\n  \"obsessionDesc\": \"<极简状态，如 持续恶化>\",\n  \"restraintPhase\": \"<如 Phase 2>\",\n  \"restraintReason\": \"<极简原因，如 拒绝进食，只接受{{user}}递来的水>\",\n  \"symptoms\": [\"<短句症状1>\", \"<短句症状2>\", \"<短句症状3>\"],\n  \"doctorNote\": \"<值班医生的简短记录，用用户的名字，克制、冷淡、像随手写的备忘，40-70字>\",\n  \"scratchNote\": \"<角色的手写批注，用用户的名字，物哀式的平静与病态，像在说一件微不足道的小事，40-70字>\"\n}\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  \n  :root {\n    --base-dark: #111111;\n    --base-card: rgba(22, 22, 22, 0.75);\n    --mist-edge: 0 0 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.88), inset 0 0 18px rgba(17,17,17,0.9), inset 0 0 5px rgba(140,140,140,0.02);\n    --t-bright: #c2c2c2;\n    --t-main: #888888;\n    --t-sub: #585858;\n    --t-accent: #7a7a7a;\n    --t-remnant: #a89585;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    background: transparent;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'SF Pro Text', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;\n    color: var(--t-main);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    padding: 4px;\n    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .mono { font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; }\n\n  .record-wrapper {\n    background: var(--base-dark);\n    background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, #181818 0%, #0a0a0a 100%);\n    border-left: 2px solid var(--t-sub);\n    border-radius: 0 !important;\n    padding: 14px 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.92), inset 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.88);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .glow-a {\n    position: absolute; width: 180px; height: 140px; top: -35px; right: -25px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(140,140,140,0.025) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    filter: blur(30px); pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .glow-b {\n    position: absolute; width: 200px; height: 160px; bottom: -60px; left: -40px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(120,120,120,0.03) 0%, transparent 70%);\n    filter: blur(35px); pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 5px;\n    font-size: 22px; font-weight: 900;\n    color: rgba(180,180,180,0.015);\n    letter-spacing: 6px; pointer-events: none; user-select: none;\n    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  }\n\n  .feather-panel {\n    background: var(--base-card);\n    border-radius: 0 !important; border: none;\n    box-shadow: var(--mist-edge);\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  .header-card { padding: 11px 13px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .header-top-row {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(140,140,140,0.06);\n    padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .header-code { font-size: 10px; color: var(--t-sub); letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n  .header-badge {\n    color: var(--t-bright); background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(100,100,100,0.08);\n    padding: 1px 7px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px; white-space: nowrap; border-radius: 0 !important;\n  }\n  .header-main-title {\n    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px;\n    color: var(--t-bright); margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .diagnosis-bar {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n    background: rgba(100,100,100,0.05);\n    border-left: 2px solid rgba(120,120,120,0.2);\n    padding: 5px 8px; font-size: 11px;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\n  }\n  .diagnosis-tag { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--t-sub); white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }\n  .diagnosis-text { color: var(--t-main); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.35; word-break: break-all; }\n\n  .patient-bar {\n    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\n    padding: 8px 13px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .patient-lbl { color: var(--t-sub); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .patient-name-val { color: var(--t-bright); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.2px; font-size: 13px; white-space: nowrap; }\n\n  .metrics-unified-block { margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .metrics-val-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .metric-col-val { padding: 9px 12px 6px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .metric-col-val:first-child { border-right: 1px solid rgba(140,140,140,0.05); }\n  .metric-label { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--t-sub); margin-bottom: 2px; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .metric-num { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--t-bright); line-height: 1.2; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .metric-num.highlight { color: var(--t-bright); }\n\n  .metrics-divider-line {\n    height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(140,140,140,0.06) 20%, rgba(140,140,140,0.06) 80%, transparent);\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .metrics-desc-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .metric-col-desc { padding: 6px 12px 9px 12px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--t-main); line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-all; }\n  .metric-col-desc:first-child { border-right: 1px solid rgba(140,140,140,0.05); }\n\n  .restraint-card { padding: 8px 13px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .restraint-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .restraint-desc { font-size: 10px; color: var(--t-main); line-height: 1.4; border-top: 1px solid rgba(140,140,140,0.05); padding-top: 5px; word-break: break-all; }\n\n  .san-section { margin-bottom: 10px; padding: 8px 13px; }\n  .san-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .san-title-text { white-space: nowrap; color: var(--t-sub); }\n  .san-val-text { white-space: nowrap; color: var(--t-bright); }\n  .san-track { height: 3px; background: #0a0a0a; border-radius: 0 !important; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); }\n  .san-bar { height: 100%; border-radius: 0 !important; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a1a1a, #888888); box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(140,140,140,0.25); transition: width 0.4s ease; }\n\n  .symptoms-box { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .symptom-item { font-size: 11px; color: var(--t-main); padding: 6px 12px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 6px; line-height: 1.4; }\n  .symptom-dot { color: var(--t-sub); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4; flex-shrink: 0; }\n\n  .log-section { padding: 10px 13px; }\n  .log-title { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--t-sub); letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }\n  .doctor-note { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--t-main); line-height: 1.65; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n\n  .scratch-note {\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(140,140,140,0.06);\n    padding-top: 9px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: var(--t-remnant);\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(168,149,133,0.12);\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"record-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"glow-a\"></div>\n  <div class=\"glow-b\"></div>\n  <div class=\"watermark\">灰</div>\n  <div id=\"app\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  function parseData() {\n    let raw = window.STATUS_RAW || '';\n    const match = raw.match(/\\[状态栏\\]([\\s\\S]*?)\\[\\/状态栏\\]/);\n    if (match) raw = match[1];\n    const jsonMatch = raw.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n    if (jsonMatch) { try { return JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]); } catch(e) {} }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  function render() {\n    const data = parseData();\n    if (!data) {\n      document.getElementById('app').innerHTML = '<div style=\"padding:16px;color:#585858;text-align:center;font-size:11px;\">[ 暂无监护档案 ]</div>';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const san = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Number(data.sanVal) || 0));\n    const symptomsHtml = (data.symptoms || []).map(s => `\n      <div class=\"symptom-item feather-panel\"><span class=\"symptom-dot\">▪</span><span>${s}</span></div>\n    `).join('');\n\n    let threatCode = data.threatLevel || 'GRADE-IV';\n    let diagnosis = data.diagnosis || '排他性依赖，认知固着';\n    const obsessionVal = data.obsessionVal || '99%';\n    const obsessionDesc = data.obsessionDesc || '';\n    const pulseVal = data.pulseVal || '--';\n    const pulseReason = data.pulseReason || '';\n    const restraintPhase = data.restraintPhase || 'Phase 0';\n    const restraintReason = data.restraintReason || '';\n\n    document.getElementById('app').innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"header-card feather-panel\">\n        <div class=\"header-top-row\">\n          <span class=\"header-code mono\">ARCHIVE // ${data.fileNo || 'MED-0826'}</span>\n          <span class=\"header-badge mono\">${threatCode}</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"header-main-title\">特级监护病历</div>\n        <div class=\"diagnosis-bar\">\n          <span class=\"diagnosis-tag mono\">[DIAGNOSIS]</span>\n          <span class=\"diagnosis-text\">${diagnosis}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"patient-bar feather-panel\">\n        <span class=\"patient-lbl\">受试对象 (SUBJECT)</span>\n        <span class=\"patient-name-val\">${data.patientName || '--'}</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"metrics-unified-block feather-panel\">\n        <div class=\"metrics-val-row\">\n          <div class=\"metric-col-val\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">执念指数</span>\n            <span class=\"metric-num highlight mono\">${obsessionVal}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"metric-col-val\">\n            <span class=\"metric-label\">实时脉搏</span>\n            <span class=\"metric-num mono\">${pulseVal}</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"metrics-divider-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"metrics-desc-row\">\n          <div class=\"metric-col-desc\">${obsessionDesc || '--'}</div>\n          <div class=\"metric-col-desc\">${pulseReason || '--'}</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"restraint-card feather-panel\">\n        <div class=\"restraint-top\">\n          <span class=\"metric-label\">拘束等级</span>\n          <span class=\"metric-num mono\" style=\"font-size:13px; font-weight:800;\">${restraintPhase}</span>\n        </div>\n        ${restraintReason ? `<div class=\"restraint-desc\">${restraintReason}</div>` : ''}\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"san-section feather-panel\">\n        <div class=\"san-header\">\n          <span class=\"san-title-text\">SAN残存 (理智阈值)</span>\n          <span class=\"san-val-text mono\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">${san} / 100</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"san-track\"><div class=\"san-bar\" style=\"width: ${san}%;\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      ${symptomsHtml ? `<div class=\"symptoms-box\">${symptomsHtml}</div>` : ''}\n\n      <div class=\"log-section feather-panel\">\n        <div class=\"log-title mono\">OBSERVATION LOG // 监护记录</div>\n        <div class=\"doctor-note\">${data.doctorNote || '无记录。'}</div>\n        ${data.scratchNote ? `<div class=\"scratch-note\">\"${data.scratchNote}\"</div>` : ''}\n      </div>\n    `;\n  }\n\n  render();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "previewRaw": "[状态栏]\n{\n  \"fileNo\": \"MED-0826\",\n  \"patientName\": \"{{char}}\",\n  \"threatLevel\": \"GRADE-IV\",\n  \"diagnosis\": \"排他性依赖，认知固着，触觉代偿\",\n  \"sanVal\": 48,\n  \"pulseVal\": \"118 BPM\",\n  \"pulseReason\": \"走廊传来{{user}}的脚步声\",\n  \"obsessionVal\": \"99.9%\",\n  \"obsessionDesc\": \"持续恶化\",\n  \"restraintPhase\": \"Phase 2\",\n  \"restraintReason\": \"拒绝进食，只接受{{user}}递来的水\",\n  \"symptoms\": [\n    \"反复默念{{user}}的名字，唇部已磨损\",\n    \"睡眠中抓握不存在的手指\",\n    \"将{{user}}触碰过的物品藏于枕下\"\n  ],\n  \"doctorNote\": \"今日查房时受试者状态平稳。坐在窗边，没有看窗外。问及{{user}}时瞳孔短暂放大，随后恢复。进食量继续下降。没有攻击倾向，暂维持现有方案。\",\n  \"scratchNote\": \"{{user}}，今天的灰好像比昨天白一点。我把你上次碰过的杯子放在枕头旁边了，这样的话，好像还能闻到一点点。\"\n}\n[/状态栏]"
}